hatter to make that move.

251
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,680
You can't lose, Bonesy.

252
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,430
Yeah.

253
00:14:33,513 --> 00:14:35,760
Skull invitation, do your dirty work.

254
00:14:41,620 --> 00:14:44,855
That's right, squeeze the
life points right out of him.

255
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,120
Now what's so funny?

256
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:50,620
You'll soon find out.

257
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:54,897
Not only are you about to lose this
duel, but when I'm done with you,

258
00:14:54,980 --> 00:14:56,900
you'll lose so much more.

259
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:01,897
You were so distracted by
the hopeless thought of

260
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:04,677
winning my locator card and
advancing to the finals,

261
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:07,466
you failed to notice
I've played a magic card.

262
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:11,560
Oh, no!

263
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:14,037
It's called Spiritualistic Medium,

264
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:17,577
and it provides my Earl of
Demise with an additional 500

265
00:15:17,660 --> 00:15:20,960
attack points for every card
destroyed during my turn.

266
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,460
It can't!

267
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:25,071
Oh, it can, and if you remember correctly,

268
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:30,780
I destroyed four of my own cards, giving
my monster 2,000 more attack points.

269
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:35,080
Go, my spirits, and add your
power to the Earl of Demise!

270
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,280
Oh, it's grown too powerful.

271
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,230
Yes.

272
00:15:42,780 --> 00:15:45,240
Earl of Demise, destroy his mana.

273
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:52,960
Oh, I lose 1,800 life points.

274
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:59,420
And because of your own trap card,
you lose 300 additional life points.

275
00:16:03,300 --> 00:16:08,620
The end is near, And when I win, you
and your friends will be trapped here.

276
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:10,291
What do you mean by that?

277
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,550
Ha!

278
00:16:11,633 --> 00:16:13,482
Just look around you, you fools.

279
00:16:13,660 --> 00:16:15,954
We've been dueling in the Shadow Realm.

280
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:19,840
I transported us here
when I first arrived.

281
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,099
What do you think?

282
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:23,780
What are those things?

283
00:16:24,420 --> 00:16:27,660
Those are lost souls trapped
forever in the darkness.

284
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:30,140
And soon you will join them.

285
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:34,224
Your soul's doomed to wander in
the darkness of the Shadow Realm.

286
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:35,457
No!

287
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:36,840
See you later, lads!

288
00:16:37,560 --> 00:16:38,780
Shane, come back!

289
00:16:39,060 --> 00:16:40,240
You won't get far.

290
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:47,800
How did I end up back here?

291
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:50,800
Let that be a lesson.

292
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:53,720
You cannot run from the Shadow Realm.

293
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:58,680
Only by defeating me in this duel
can you hope to escape its clutches.

294
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:03,620
Bones, whatever you do,
don't you dare lose this!

295
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:05,980
Or we'll end up like these guys!

296
00:17:08,320 --> 00:17:10,120
Okay, let me see here.

297
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:13,860
Hey, not bad.

298
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:17,820
I play the magic card
Nightmare Steel Cage!

299
00:17:19,460 --> 00:17:22,617
You'll be trapped in my
cage for two whole turns,

300
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:25,437
preventing you from
attacking till you're free.

301
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:29,060
But just in case, I'll play
this magic card face down.

302
00:17:29,300 --> 00:17:30,300
You got him good.

303
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:32,917
Now you have two titans to
wipe out his life point.

304
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:33,830
Duh.

305
00:17:33,913 --> 00:17:34,997
Think I don't know that?

306
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:36,820
I draw one card.

307
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:41,540
Aw, disappointed because you can't move.

308
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:45,457
On the contrary, I'm disappointed
because this duel has to end,

309
00:17:45,540 --> 00:17:47,800
and I want it to prolong your misery.

310
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:49,977
What are you talking about?

311
00:17:50,060 --> 00:17:52,757
As long as you're trapped
in my nightmare steel cage,

312
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:56,577
None of your monsters can carry
out an attack for two full turns.

313
00:17:56,660 --> 00:17:58,248
That's only partially true.

314
00:17:58,420 --> 00:18:01,185
There is one card that
can penetrate your cage.

315
00:18:02,700 --> 00:18:03,900
Activate Ectoplasma.

316
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:11,397
Ectoplasma extracts the very soul of my
monster and transforms it into an energy

317
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:16,186
so powerful it can penetrate your cage
and destroy the rest of your life points.

318
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:17,580
No way! Yes!

319
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:21,620
Now go, Ectoplasma, and
finish these fools off now!

320
00:18:23,780 --> 00:18:24,610
Oh!

321
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,110
Hey, you!

322
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,400
Stop your whimpering.

323
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:32,780
Nothing can save you now. It's over. Oh!

324
00:18:33,420 --> 00:18:35,540
You dueled me and lost.

325
00:18:35,780 --> 00:18:41,420
And now you must all wander the Shadow
Realm until I choose to set you free.

326
00:18:42,420 --> 00:18:43,250
Oh!

327
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:44,590
Oh!

328
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:46,660
Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!

329
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:50,830
Oh!

330
00:18:52,700 --> 00:18:57,100
Now it's on to the Battle City finals
to fulfill my agreement with Marek.

331
00:18:57,340 --> 00:19:00,920
And soon, I will obtain
the world's greatest power.
